category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libpcre2-devel libssh2-devel libcom_err-devel libkrb5-devel libssl-devel zlib-devel mbedtls-devel
sdesc: "The Git linkable library"
ldesc: "libgit2 is a portable, pure C implementation of the Git core methods provided
as a linkable library with a solid API, allowing to build Git functionality into your application.."
